<title>UK: Cyprus prices $300 mln five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Cyprus prices $300 mln five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been priced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   REPUBLIC OF CYPRUS</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	COUPON     6.625     MATURITY    26.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.025   PAY DATE    26.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.40     SPREAD	+37 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A2	  LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/CY</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   TAX PROVS  STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5YR W/I</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
